---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConnectBanner from '../components/ConnectBanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Me | Javier Carrion (Javi)"
  description="Software Engineer with over 6 years of professional development and 25+ years in technology. Learn about my technical background, community leadership, and engineering philosophy."
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="badge-gold">About Me</div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Engineering With Purpose & Fundamentals</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        I'm Javier Carrion, often known as Javi. I'm a bilingual software engineer who builds practical software solutions, solves complex technical problems, and helps engineering communities grow.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Main Story Column -->
      <div class="about-content">
        <section class="about-section">
          <h2>Background & Journey</h2>
          <p>
            My journey in technology spans more than 25 years, starting in computer systems, technical customer support, and software quality assurance before transitioning into full-time software engineering over six years ago.
          </p>
          <p>
            This non-traditional foundation gives me a distinctive engineering perspective: I don't just write code to make a feature work today; I write code with a deep appreciation for edge cases, regression prevention, maintainability, and end-user empathy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2>Core Technical Expertise</h2>
          <p>
            My day-to-day engineering focuses on scalable frontend architectures and full-stack integration:
          </p>
          <ul class="experience-list">
            <li>
              <strong>Frontend Engineering:</strong> Angular, TypeScript, modern JavaScript, Vue, HTML5, semantic CSS/Sass, responsive design, and component design systems.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Modern Reactivity:</strong> Early adopter and advocate of fine-grained reactive primitives (Signals) and zone-less architectures.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Backend & Data:</strong> Node.js, Express.js, RESTful API design and maintenance, and MySQL schema migrations. I also have experience with PostgreSQL.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Quality & Delivery:</strong> Comprehensive unit testing, regression testing, CI/CD pipelines, Git workflows, and Agile/Scrum methodologies (Certified Professional Scrum Master I).
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2>Community & Knowledge Sharing</h2>
          <p>
            I firmly believe that explaining concepts to others is the greatest way to master them. As an organizer for <strong>Google Developer Groups (GDG) Central Florida</strong> and <strong>GDG Ocala</strong>, and co-organizer of <strong>DevFest Florida</strong>, I regularly present technical sessions on Angular Signals, modern frontend practices, and developer tooling.
          </p>
          <p>
            I also actively mentor junior engineers on clean code, Git practices, software architecture, and practical problem-solving.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar Bento Cards -->
      <aside class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="bento-card sidebar-card">
          <div class="sidebar-avatar-wrapper">
            <img src="/assets/images/Me.png" alt="Javier Carrion" class="sidebar-avatar" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="sidebar-name">Javier Carrion</h3>
          <p class="sidebar-role">Software Engineer</p>
          <p class="sidebar-location">📍 Central Florida (Ocala), USA</p>

          <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>

          <div class="sidebar-highlights">
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <span class="highlight-num">6+</span>
              <span class="highlight-label">Years Software Engineering</span>
            </div>
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <span class="highlight-num">25+</span>
              <span class="highlight-label">Years in Technology</span>
            </div>
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <span class="highlight-num">PSM I</span>
              <span class="highlight-label">Certified Scrum Master</span>
            </div>
            <div class="highlight-item">
              <span class="highlight-num">EN / ES</span>
              <span class="highlight-label">Bilingual (English & Spanish)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>

          <div class="sidebar-links">
            <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/code-vista.bsky.social" class="sidebar-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Bluesky
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/technologic"
              class="sidebar-link"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              data-umami-event="linkedin_profile_click"
            >
              LinkedIn
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/JavaVista"
              class="sidebar-link"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              data-umami-event="github_profile_click"
            >
              GitHub
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://sessionize.com/javier-carrion/"
              class="sidebar-link"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              data-umami-event="speaking_link_click"
              data-umami-event-type="sessionize_profile"
            >
              Sessionize
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <ConnectBanner />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: var(--space-10);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-10);
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 340px;
    }
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-section p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .experience-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .experience-list li {
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .experience-list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Sidebar Card */
  .sidebar-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }

  .sidebar-avatar-wrapper {
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 3px solid var(--accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .sidebar-avatar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .sidebar-name {
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
  }

  .sidebar-role {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--accent-primary-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .sidebar-location {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .sidebar-divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--border-subtle);
    margin: var(--space-5) 0;
  }

  .sidebar-highlights {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .highlight-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
  }

  .highlight-num {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--accent-primary-text);
  }

  .highlight-label {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .sidebar-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .sidebar-link {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
    background-color: var(--bg-surface-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .sidebar-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent-primary-text);
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
  }
</style>
